{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/titleslide.png?t=1753364607\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short Sci-fi adventure game made for the Game Boy Color in GB Studio! Solve puzzles, collect energy for your weapons, and fight the alien Ackloids to claim the planet Proxima B for the humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/title_slide2.png?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-based level progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemies and creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels, each with unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full 8-bit soundtrack and art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player color customizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/title_slide3.png?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__72_.png?t=1753364607\" /></div><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Earth is in ruins after a large asteroid hit it about 10 years ago. You sign up to be an IASA Combat Astronaut to help fix your home world, as well as find a new one. You were assigned to help survey the land and &quot;tame&quot; the planet for human colonization. But, disaster strikes when you  and your co-pilot, Xelendra (Xel), land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/pixil-frame-0__73_.png?t=1753364607\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another alien race, the Ackloids, are attempting to colonize the planet for themselves and  aren't up for any negotiations. With an attack on the human command ship, the only other human who can help is an injured Xel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you have what it takes to defeat the Ackloids and save the human race? Find out in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/proxima-logo.png?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/title_slide4.png?t=1753364607\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles with buttons, your energy weapons, and creatures to open doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/puzzels.gif?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/secret-resized.gif?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades for your weapons and reach the Ackloid command ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/upgrade.gif?t=1753364607\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The gameplay images shown are pre-production content and are subject to change.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718720?t=1753364607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/fbe8f23c5138673cb162f14112d7abb10b84ee33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753364607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/5f650bc1ac8001762971fa5907471e474f20d5e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753364607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea